# Logs
*.log

# Rust build output (each crate also ignores its own target/)
target/

# kokoro-protocol is a path-dep library, not built standalone — no lockfile of its own
# (the binary crates that consume it commit theirs). Ignore the stray one cargo leaves.
kokoro-protocol/Cargo.lock

# Editor / OS
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.sw?

# Scratch audio dumps from the SAPI smoke test
*.wav

# kokoro-timing-probe: the model artifacts and saved runs, not the scripts.
# ~640 MB of .onnx and .npz that must never be staged - the scripts regenerate all of it
# from the model the app already downloaded, which is the point of keeping them.
kokoro-timing-probe/*.onnx
kokoro-timing-probe/out/
